%% name: 06-ask-on-the-vm
%% keep: hand
%% One Ask, from the page to the answer, on the one-VM deploy.
%% The browser holds this HTTP request open until the final JSON returns.
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Web app
    participant Caddy
    participant API as API process
    participant PG as Postgres
    participant Neo as Neo4j
    participant Embed as Embedding API
    participant Chat as Chat API

    User->>UI: Question on /app/ask
    Note over UI: Session cookie is httpOnly.<br/>Model keys are in the JSON body.
    UI->>Caddy: POST /api/ask
    Caddy->>API: POST /ask
    Note over Caddy,API: TLS ends at Caddy. /api is removed.<br/>The proxy stays open for the whole Ask.

    API->>PG: Cookie to session to user id
    PG-->>API: This user
    API->>Neo: Load this user's graph
    Neo-->>API: Documents, entities, statements
    Note over API: That graph stays in memory<br/>for the rest of this request.

    loop One model turn at a time, at most 12 tool calls
        API->>Chat: Question and observations so far
        Chat-->>API: A tool call, or the final answer
        alt search_graph
            API->>Embed: Embed this search query
            Embed-->>API: Vector
            Note over API: Similarity, then PageRank,<br/>on the graph already loaded.
        else read_document
            API->>PG: Up to 3 stored passages<br/>for a file search already returned
            PG-->>API: Passage text
        end
    end

    API-->>Caddy: Answer, steps, highlight ids
    Caddy-->>UI: Same JSON
    UI-->>User: Steps and answer
